# Generated QA evidence and local plugin evaluation transcripts. Only
# .agentic-qa/manifest.json is tracked state: it declares this repository as a
# QA target of itself (Q09 dogfooding). Everything else the ledger writes is
# session-local, can contain environment-specific detail, and is disposable.
.agentic-qa/*
!.agentic-qa/manifest.json
.eval-workspaces/
